Z||000000||Raydar||10-27-2001||10:40 AM||||Anybody have a microwave/hood combination made by whirlpool or kenmore?<BR>If it's got a serial number that starts with XC, the CPSC says it's a fire hazard. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.cpsc.gov/cpscpub/prerel/prhtml02/02018.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cpsc.gov/cpscpub/prerel/prhtml02/02018.html</A> <P>They say to unplug it immediately. <BR>They will even reimburse you $100 towards the purchase of a countertop model. <BR>(I *don't* think I'll buy a whirlpool.)<P>I've *got* one of the damn things.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR>Thought I'd share. <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
